Why do we use an Instance Template?
"An Instance Template defines the VM configuration, such as machine type, boot disk, network, startup script, and service account. It enables consistent creation of multiple VM instances and is required for Managed Instance Groups."
Why do we use a Managed Instance Group?
"A Managed Instance Group automatically manages identical VM instances. It supports auto healing, auto scaling, and seamless integration with Load Balancers, ensuring high availability."
